.TH revpi_ro_ioctl_counters 2type 2026-08-14 "Linux"

.SH NAME
revpi_ro_ioctl_counters \- piControl driver struct for retrieving wear counters
of RO expansion modules

.SH LIBRARY
piControl device driver ioctl interface

.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B "#include <piControl.h>"
.sp
.B struct revpi_ro_ioctl_counters {
.BR "    __u8   addr;" "                          /* address of module in current configuration */"
.BR "    __u32  counter[REVPI_RO_NUM_RELAYS];" "  /* wear counters for each relay */"
.B } __attribute__((__packed__));
.fi

.SH DESCRIPTION
Contains information about how many times each relay has been activated for a
single RO expansion module.

The fields are as follows:

.TP
.I addr
This field contains the address of the expansion module on the piBridge bus.
.TP
.I counter
This field contains an array, each item representing how many times a relay of
the RO expansion module has been activated.

.SH SEE ALSO

.BR ioctl (2),
.BR KB_RO_GET_COUNTER (2)
